[00:00.05]Phong Max - Waiting For Love (Remix)
[00:01.85]Where there's a will there's a way kind of beautiful
[00:05.66]And every night has it's day so magical
[00:09.76]And if there's love in this life there's no obstacle
[00:13.61]That can't be defeated
[00:18.12]Monday left me broken
[00:21.05]Tuesday I was through with hoping
[00:24.96]Wednesday my empty arms were open
[00:28.91]Thursday waiting for love waiting for love
[00:33.82]Thank the stars it's Friday
[00:36.71]I'm burning like a fire gone wild on Saturday
[00:40.72]Guess I won't be coming to church on Sunday
[00:44.62]I'll be waiting for love waiting for love
[00:49.47]To come around
[00:53.34]We are one of a kind irreplaceable
[00:56.89]How did I get so blind and so cynical
